 "nl": [
  "Allow vpn-users to connect to dev-lab using IMAP (TCP 143).",
  "Deny all traffic from edge-cache to dmz-web (this overrides any public service).",
  "dev-lab is isolated: it may only reach nvr on syslog (UDP 514); vpn-users on NTP (UDP 123), and nothing else.",
  "No packet from vpn-users may enter dmz-web, even for services open to everyone.",
  "printers must accept DNS over UDP 53 and LDAP (TCP 389) from vpn-users.",
  "Hosts in ops may reach iot-sensors over DNS over UDP 53 and SNMP (UDP 161).",
  "ops must never reach dmz-web, regardless of any other rule.",
  "No packet from dmz-web may enter ops, even for services open to everyone."
 ],
